n-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle had April to May at 172% of normal and November to December at 31%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 38% of normal and February to March at 43% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
